            "review_title": "Review at Okii-D Omakase & Teppanyaki Restaurant",
            "review_text": "jshcc\nHonolulu, Hawaii3 contributions\n0\nOkii-D is a Hanoi Essential\nJun 2024 • Friends\nOkii-D has an amazing omakase experience. It's one of the best omakase meals I've ever had. The sushi presentation was just next level great. If you're visiting Hanoi and love sushi, this place is a must.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 28, 2024",
