            "review_title": "Review at Okii-D Omakase & Teppanyaki Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Anastasia P\n17 contributions\n0\nFood as Art\nNov 2023 • Couples\nWhat an incredible Japanese dinner, an artwork of food. The chefs were precise and thoughtful preparing everything before our eyes with presentation you could only dream of. The master chef went out of his way to describe the dishes and ingredients in his best English too. Many raw fish and egg dishes, exquisite flavours. The staff were attentive. Dinner was fine dining, $300 AUD for two. Our international Mastercard did not work in their eftpos machine and so we then paid cash, but the attitude to the eftpos error (out of our control) was not pleasant for us. An unfortunate end to an incredible experience. I do recommend going but encourage taking cash.\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2023",
